# A nonlinear version of Halanay inequality and application to neural networks theory

**Authors:** N. Tatar

## Abstract
. We establish an exponential stability result for a delayed Hop ﬁ eld neural network. This is proved in case one or more of the activation functions fails to satisfy the standard Lip-schitz continuity condition. We use a nonlinear version of Halanay inequality, which we prove here.

